Oh My Git! on the web

Oh My Git! was created by bleeptrack and blinry in 2020/2021, with six months
of funding from the Prototype Fund (https://www.prototypefund.de).

The original game:
https://github.com/git-learning-game/oh-my-git
https://blinry.itch.io/oh-my-git

This is an unofficial web port. It plays the original levels in the browser.
Level files, card art, and node art come from the original project and stay
under that project's license. They are not relicensed here.

